              "D-002 — accepted"
            ],
            "excerpt": "## D-002 — accepted\n\nThe accepted annual price is 19000 euro cents per seat, replacing D-001.\nNotify by email only after the third failed retry; intermediate retries are silent.\nSwitching from monthly to annual takes effect at the next renewal date.\nThere is no immediate prorated charge when requesting that switch.\n\n",
