              "Billing policy",
              "Cancellation and refunds"
            ],
            "excerpt": "## Cancellation and refunds\n\nCancellation stops the next renewal; access continues until the paid term ends.\nThe refund request window is 14 calendar days after the initial payment.\nChanging the billing period must preserve that refund window.\n\n",
